<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 24/25.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 24/25.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Thursday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for July 24/25. The kroon is pegged</p>
<p>at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	     July 24/25	July 23/24</p>
<p>    CZK    0.42778	    0.42384</p>
<p>    DKK    2.10148	    2.10203</p>
<p>    FIM    2.71663	    2.71623</p>
<p>    GBP   24.47309	   24.61892</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07483	    0.07495</p>
<p>    LTL    3.65322	    3.65618</p>
<p>    LVL   25.2581	    25.30577</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00252	    0.00253</p>
<p>    SEK    1.86372	    1.86754</p>
<p>    UAH    7.86948	    7.87786</p>
<p>    USD   14.6156	    14.628</p>
<p>    XEU   15.83966	   15.87065</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
